{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8c7742be-1295-85e3-8c44-0c35d7014346",
  "created_at": "2026-01-30T12:10:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lucille Ricci",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:07:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:07:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. My water bill came and it's huge. Well, the shop is on the second floor, so the pipes, no, sorry, you asked what I need. The usage is way too high."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:08:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Is this a business account or a home account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:08:07-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Business. I have a little shop. Well, it's a shop and the account is, um, it's still in my husband's name. He passed, and I never got it switched over. Ricci, that's the name on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:08:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, I'm sorry to hear that. We can get the name changed over for you. So what's bothering you about the usage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:08:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I was out of town for six weeks. Closed up, nobody in the building. And the bill shows like a ton of consumption. Which, I'm sorry, the date. Yes, the bill is from this month."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:08:40-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So the meter reading covers a stretch when the shop was empty. A couple of things can cause that. Sometimes a bill is estimated and then a real reading catches up, so it looks like a jump. Or there could be a leak, like a running toilet, something that runs the whole time nobody's there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:09:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it wasn't running when I got back. I'd have heard it. Or no, I didn't check the toilet, I checked the faucets."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:09:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I can't see the meter history from here, so I'd have the meter folks look at the readings and see whether it was estimated or actual. Do you want me to put in that request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:09:22-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. And can somebody call me back with an actual answer? I don't want a letter. I check the price of eggs every week out of habit, so believe me, I notice when a number's off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:09:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. What's the best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:09:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0156. That's the shop line, I'm here weekdays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:09:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0156, under Ricci, high usage while you were away, wants a callback. I'll note the name change too so we can send you the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:09:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I just want it looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:09:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Someone will be in touch. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:10:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
